{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-14","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：可公度量与平方与比例","englishTitle":"If four straight lines be proportional, and the square on the first be greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line commensurable with the first, the square on the third will also be greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a straight line commensurable with the third.","book":10,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","contentId":"euclid-10-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1028dcbb04fd3833ae96aa35fb2fbdcbf152581f46b9e60eac2f8d28fd1737f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-14.statement","euclid-10-14.proof.1","euclid-10-14.construction.1","euclid-10-14.proof.2","euclid-10-14.proof.3","euclid-10-14.proof.4","euclid-10-14.proof.5","euclid-10-14.proof.6","euclid-10-14.conclusion","euclid-10-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0db369e27a98869e3981c5e65be83f2750ca8911319593cbd7e2802bccaba52b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four straight lines be proportional, and the square on the first be greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line commensurable with the first, the square on the third will also be greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a straight line commensurable with the third."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果4条直线为成比例,而第1条直线的正方形大于第二条正方形,再乘正方形直线可公度,第三条直线正方形也大于第四条正方形,再乘正方形直线可公度,再乘第三条直线可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd1d71d832ff2fcfd36fe389ee5765b84771a19af35d0531afd3072e69198e01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the square on the first be greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the first, the square on the third will also be greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a straight line in- commensurable with the third."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果第1行的正方形比第2行的正方形比第不可公度行的正方形比第3行的不可公度比正方形,第3行的正方形也比第4行的正方形比第正方形比第可公度行的可公度和第3行的正方形要大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"597a2f09316fa402b49556c83a5869c73125da26e7c7581e149d44db1ca9f0b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, D be four straight lines in proportion, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D; and let the square on A be greater than the square on B by the square on E, and let the square on C be greater than the square on D by the square on F; I say that, if A is commensurable with E, C is also commensurable with F, and, if A is incommensurable with E, C is also incommensurable with F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C,D成四条直线,A比B等于C比D;让A比正方形比B比正方形比E比正方形,让C比D比正方形比正方形比F比正方形;我说,如果A是可公度,E,C也是可公度,F,A是不可公度,E,C也是不可公度,F；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a952a84595e61db199a3a9751fc20e1d072fb41e490d7bbad715e3bcb231b7c","citations":["euclid-6-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as A is to B, so is C to D, therefore also, as the square on A is to the square on B, so is the square on C to the square on D. [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B的比例等于C比D,A比正方形,B比正方形,C比正方形；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03a87f45258c0f602c3f68ed6fe496a273f5db4a1b95ed4dd32bd96f9df22106","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on E, B are equal to the square on A, and the squares on D, F are equal to the square on C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是E,B的正方形等于A的正方形,D的正方形等于C的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51e890da07fe8c4d68188101be5c6bce1ae1abb74a8c11b15edb7c9a02b9d24f","citations":["euclid-5-17","euclid-6-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the squares on E, B are to the square on B, so are the squares on D, F to the square on D; therefore, separando, as the square on E is to the square on B, so is the square on F to the square on D; [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)] therefore also, as E is to B, so is F to D; [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)] therefore, inversely, as B is to E, so is D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，以 E、B 为边作的正方形面积之和与以 B 为边作的正方形面积之比，等于以 D、F 为边作的正方形面积之和与以 D 为边作的正方形面积之比。分离对应项后，以 E 为边作的正方形与以 B 为边作的正方形之比，等于以 F 为边作的正方形与以 D 为边作的正方形之比；于是 E 与 B 之比等于 F 与 D 之比，反过来 B 与 E 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。 [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)] [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5cbb2230920c652a0760fccef86a225c550caa17125030c9e3bce22ad0df6ca","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so also is C to D; therefore, ex aequali, as A is to E, so is C to F. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A比B,C比D,因此,从平等角度看,A比E等于C比F；A 与 E 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1669c8067a7bbd2643e1980f2a1f27fbcfef33a9f43c4583f1dea4c6d73a5b9","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if A is commensurable with E, C is also commensurable with F, and, if A is incommensurable with E, C is also incommensurable with F. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果A是可公度,E,C也是可公度,F,A是不可公度,E,C也是不可公度,F。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-14.source","contentId":"euclid-10-14","revisionId":"euclid-10-14@raw-d1028dcbb04fd383","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f11c81f835d4741507cd20fa943a5b46d5debc623ec0c7d5e3ef0b50b762191c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-14:euclid-6-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-14.proof.2","euclid-10-14.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14/","sourceLabel":"VI. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-14:euclid-5-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-14.p